  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The second son leaves to establish a grain market.",
  "[action] The second son leaves to establish a grain market.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"And what now?\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We are going to be poor men and we live like the poor men.\"",
  "[says] Wang Lung demands an explanation.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now why should we be poor men?\"",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"We are going to be poor men because the land is taken away from us.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son walks in a circle.",
  "[action] Wang Lung listens to his sons.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We have to be poor men now because the land is taken from us.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"And who has taken the land?\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The second son points to the east.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"The Landlord, the one who has no land, the one who lives in a house as big as the one we live in, and the one who has more silver than we have in all our lives!\"",
